      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3523275852203369
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "De-facto complainant is represented.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 1369,
      "end": 1406,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.41607335209846497
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "The investigations are yet to be concluded.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 1407,
      "end": 1450,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.46935147047042847
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "Mere delay in the lodgment of the FIR is not fatal to the case of the prosecution.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 1451,
      "end": 1533,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.66858971118927
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "The 164 Cr.P.C. statement of the victim, at this stage, should not be overlooked.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 1534,
      "end": 1616,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Cr.P.C.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1543,
          "end": 1550
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.6369699835777283
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "There she implicates the petitioner of rape.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 1617,
      "end": 1661,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5669888257980347
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "In such circumstances, we are unable to grant anticipatory bail to the petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 1662,
      "end": 1745,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4939992427825928
    },
    {
